	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100%" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="center" border="5"><tbody><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/back2.jpg"><span class="tableheading"><font size="+1">Class</font></span></th><th valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/back2.jpg"><span class="tableheading"><font size="+1">Level</font></span></th><th valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/back2.jpg"><span class="tableheading"><font size="+1">Spell</font></span></th><th valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/back2.jpg"><span class="tableheading"><font size="+1">Description</font></span></th></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Priest </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">1 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Minor Healing </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes Health instantly to a group member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Priest </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Smite </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Divine damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Priest </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">4 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Minor Archhealing </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Major replenishment of Health instantly to a group member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Priest </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">5 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Courage </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Grants Stamina and Trauma (Crushing, Slashing, &amp;Piercing) mitigation to the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Priest </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">6 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Cure Noxious </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Cures Poison and Disease ailments from the target group member. Curatives can fail if the relevant ailments are significantly more potent than the caster&#39;s ability. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Priest </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">6.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Summon Food and Water </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Summons Food and Drink for the target group member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Priest </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">7 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Weakness </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Reduces the targets strength. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Priest </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">8 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Revive </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Resurrects a dead target. (Caster cannot be directly engaged in combat) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Priest </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">9 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Enduring Breath </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Underwater Breathing. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">10 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Rebuke </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Reduces Trauma (Crushing, Slashing, &amp; Piercing) mitigations on the target. (Can only be focused on one target at a time) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Divine Awakening </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Summons a divine essence to ressurect a priest. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Radiant Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Mental damage to the target opponent. (Does additional instant Divine damage if the target is Undead) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">12 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Bestowal of Vitae </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation that instantly heals the target group member when they are successfully attacked, but has a limited number of heals before expiring. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Cure Trauma </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Cures Crushing, Slashing, and Piercing ailments from the target group member. Curatives can fail if the relevant ailments are significantly more potent than the caster&#39;s ability. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">13.2 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Distract </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Point-blank area of effect Hate reduction. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">13.4 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Odyssey </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Transports the target party member to their home city, specifically to the temple of each city. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">14 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Symbol of Transal </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the maximum hit points for all group members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">14.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Soothing Sermon </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation, placed on each group member, that instantly heals the group member when they are successfully attacked, but has a limited number of heals before expiring. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Prayer of Amelioration </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Group Heal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">15.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Radiance </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes Health instantly to a target group member. This replenishment does not have a casting time, nor does it cost Power, but it has a significant re-use timer. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Combat Healing </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instant heal plus offense buff. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Abmonishing Smite </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals divine damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Mark of Pawns </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment that is cast on a target opponent that has a chance to replenish Health over-time and increase Armor Class when the opponent is successfully attacked. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Elemental Aid </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Elemental Cure </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Cleric </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Daring </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Grants Stamina and Trauma (Crushing/Slashing/Piercing) mitigation to the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Amending Fate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Impairment that heals the group when the target opponent is slain. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Faith Respect </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Enforces a faithful respect of the templar. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Sign of Weakness </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Area of effect strength debuff. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Battle Reprieve </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Ressurects the target, can be used during combat. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Disgrace </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Reduces Trauma (Crushing, Slashing, &amp; Piercing) mitigations on the target. (Can only be focused on one target at a time) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Combative Faith </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Divine damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Watery Respite </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grants enduring breath and increases swimming speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Celestial Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Mental damage to the target opponent. (Does additional instant Divine damage if the target is Undead) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Supplicants Prayer </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Casts a reactive heal on the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Protectorate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Strength and Wisdom on the target party member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Placate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Point-blank area of effect Hate reduction. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Healing Touch </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instant group heal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Intercession </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grants the target a chance of being healed and receiving increased ac when hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Amelioration </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instant heal plus offense buff. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Protective Faith </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Power and Arcane mitigation for the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Blessing </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Blesses the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">30.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Pious Redoubt </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Health pool on the target party member (Compatible with the Symbol spell line) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Restoration </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instantly heals the target and has a chance to cure noxious effects. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Beams of Faith </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Divine damage to the target and surrounding encounter members </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">32.4 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Mark of Princes </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment that is cast on a target opponent that has a chance to replenish Health over-time and increase Armor Class when the opponent is successfully attacked. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">34 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Redemptive Fate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment that heals the group when the target opponent is slain. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Sign of Debility </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect strength debuff. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Detect Evil </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Detects nearby Evil. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Involuntary Healer </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment that has a chance to Cure Trauma impairments and replenish Health over-time on the victim when the target opponent attacks. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">37 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Watery Abeyance </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grants water breathing and increases swimming skill. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">38.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Warring Faith </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Divine damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">39 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Prostrate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Stuns the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Inquisitor </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">39.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Divine Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Mental damage to the target opponent. (Does additional instant Divine damage if the target is Undead) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Greater Intercession </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instantly heals the target and has a chance to increase ac when hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">40.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Praetorate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Strength and Wisdom on the target party member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar/Inquisitor </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Salvation </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Rescues a party member who is taken to the verge of death by averting the death and replenishing Health. The rescue is not guaranteed to activate. (Can only be focused on one target at a time) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Harmony </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Heals the target and reduces hate. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Resolve </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Prevents three attacks made against the caster and reduces Hate towards the attacker for each of these prevented attacks. Attackers that overmatch the caster have the chance to ignore the prevention. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Word of Restoration </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Group heal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Crucial Intercession </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Group reactive heal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">43 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Greater Amelioration </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instantly heals the target and increases offensive skills for a short period of time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">43.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shielding Faith </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Power and Arcane mitigation for the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar/Inquisitor </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">44.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Sacred Redoubt </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Health pool on the target party member. (Compatible with the Symbol spell line) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Holy Acolyte </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Summons an acolyte. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Condemning Smite </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Deals divine damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Holy Aura </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Covers the Caster in a holy aura. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Vigilant Benediction </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Armor Class on the target group member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Rays of Faith </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect divince damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Greater Restoration </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instantly heals the target and has a chance to cure minor noxious effects. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Mark of Kings </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">? </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Valor </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups stamina, mental mitigation and ac. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Glory of Combat </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grants each group member a chance to be healed on each successful attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">48 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Atoning Fate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Heals the group when the target dies. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">49 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Sign of Infirmity </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect strength debuff. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">49 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Involuntary Curate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grants a chance that the target will be healed and trauma cured, when hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Templar </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Focused Benefaction </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Reactive heal. </td></tr></tbody></table>
	
